[00:00.00][by:魏琦芮]
[00:01.96]Forgotten how long I've been waiting
[00:01.96]忘了等了多久
[00:08.23]And as always I'm stuck on the same thing
[00:08.23]一如往常我迷恋上了同一件事情
[00:16.37]You and the perfect unfailing
[00:16.37]你和完美的永恒
[00:23.57]Love that you may bring me
[00:23.57]爱 也许你能带给我
[00:31.79]Know you won't come for me
[00:31.79]知道你不会来
[00:38.76]But faith knows no reality
[00:38.76]但是信仰不懂事实
[00:48.93]So I'll wait an eternity
[00:48.93]所以我会等到来世
[00:53.14]Here for you
[00:53.14]我在这里
[00:57.84]I'll be waiting for you
[00:57.84]在这里等着你
[01:05.69]Right here waiting for you
[01:05.69]就在这儿等着你
[01:14.12]It's alwas the same thing
[01:14.12]一直都是这样
[01:17.88]But I'm not complaining
[01:17.88]但我不会抱怨
